# Server and client

Details: `.cursor/memory/architecture.md`, `protocol.md`, `config.md`.

- Settings: CLI > env > `payphone.toml` > defaults. Load from repo-root CWD.
- Server capabilities: `CAP_IPV4 | CAP_DNS | CAP_RESUME` only. Drop DATA whose IPv4 source ≠ assigned address.
- Sessions: idle 300s, rekey 3600s, sequence reorder window 1024. Store magic `PAYS`. Device limit evicts oldest session (`CloseReason::Replaced`).
- Client resume file `.payphone-session`: magic `PAYE`, ChaCha20-Poly1305, key `SHA256("payphone-session-v1" || psk)`.
- Ping jitter 7–14s. DNS stub is `10.77.0.1:53`.
- Matrix TUI (`matrix.rs`): half-width katakana only.
- Do not enable REALITY in server compose without dest + keys.
